-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003241_280736640614427_2079450943404390005_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QWPrVnONmLoQ7kNvwFvFSGY&_nc_oc=AdkOnzEkNXMMM9EP3nSrZpagCdKomBtLP4K0TN1zdUfb_D0hF1iwY2ir7aqa6xoFkH4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfuL5qjwqQaqlRBJi1LMyLtLGZ8aE0kqJl7AmXiaejX8Sw&oe=69A82C75"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_5.png", "id": "697956894520220", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031440_697956901186886_5235259129555712544_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PYLI8Y-ybWgQ7kNvwE_ykpQ&_nc_oc=Adnfe2wbDHL-Bt5-YOGKFnpdpIYqut7mhk4M9aWLT-BkhRQjXhm8h3rS1mtraLWimAI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfvQbMe4SuXOwFBxjJG7FMkaZPeDyHvCCIgbBBz0_g9_tw&oe=69A82044"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover_Querformat.png", "id": "4779750352059112", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035406_4779750362059111_808409654242061204_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zQJuBnIbCJcQ7kNvwGFjnP7&_nc_oc=AdmJu1t2yqdc76uv8G8-3bP3d5l3Dc1sLqaqgzlF0pZA5b6XFwSNGf2X1oUa3E3MsWA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfuPvF62rIvrdq4zsGmRHTxgIJ7Z4JmiJ0FTSmNBwGoIqA&oe=69A813BE"}, "display_name": "Virtual Kitchen", "keywords": [], "long_description": "To make the training of the 110 apprentices of the KWP (Consortium of Viennese Retirement Homes) as modern and varied as possible, we developed a VR application around the topic of \u201cmeat\u201d: Where does it come from? How is it processed? And above all: What does responsible handling of this food look like? After all, a schnitzel \u201cdoesn\u2019t come into the world vacuum-packed in the supermarket,\u201d as KWP chef Peter Haidbauer sums it up in our case video.\n\n", "short_description": "Bon appetite! We bring apprentice chefs into the virtual kitchen to teach them how to responsibly handle meat."}]}, "developer_name": "Junge R\u00f6mer"